      "day": 2,
      "title": "Highland Trails and Ilam Explorations",
      "narrative": "The day winds through elevated viewpoints and lush landscapes of Ilam, visiting Gagre Vanjyang, the serene zero point, the panoramic Soyak, and the quiet Dhobi dhara, immersing in the region's rural charm and sweeping hill vistas."
    },
    {
      "day": 3,
      "title": "Darjeeling at Lease and Cultural Immersion",
      "narrative": "A free day in the hills to wander local lanes, engage with community spots, and absorb the layered mountain atmosphere at one's own pace, reflecting on the journeys' scenic and cultural passages."
    },
